{"id":"steam-751810","steam":751810,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Antimatter Drive","summary":"A PvP starship-building auto battler! Strategically craft, place, and synergize weapons to outsmart real opponents.","about":"Build the most powerful starship and dominate the entire galaxy.\n\nStrategically choose your items and build your ship deck to transform a humble vessel into a mighty battlecruiser—feared across the galaxy, even by the mightiest of empires\n\n\r\n\r\n\n \n\nEngage in epic, cutthroat battles across the solar systems as you face off against the ship builds of real players. Watch missiles explode and lasers light up the battlefield in a dazzling display of chaos.\n\n \n\n• \nStrategic PvP auto-battler\n• \nBuild your starship by carefully placing, rotating, and synergizing powerful items\n• \nHexagonal inventory grid for deeper tactical gameplay\n• \nCraft and unlock superior weapons and equipment\n• \nAsynchronous multiplayer battles with ELO-ranked matchmaking","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/library_600x900.jpg?t=1744215820","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/header.jpg?t=1744215820","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/library_hero.jpg?t=1744215820","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/header.jpg?t=1744215820","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/dfd03d20b87e94758fbee1571f6ba1752b1e41b3/ss_dfd03d20b87e94758fbee1571f6ba1752b1e41b3.600x338.jpg?t=1744215820","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/dfd03d20b87e94758fbee1571f6ba1752b1e41b3/ss_dfd03d20b87e94758fbee1571f6ba1752b1e41b3.jpg?t=1744215820"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/151cfb6a6c6b41b286394744a573626cf2d454ec/ss_151